{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c12","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c12-h","content":"You finished the reproduction quiz!"},{"type":"text","id":"c12-m","content":"Well done. Plants and animals make new living things so their kind carries on."}],"actions":[]}}
